// The SDK lives in this checkout; there is no published module.
//
// A REPLACE PATH IS A FUNCTION OF WHERE THIS FOLDER SITS. This copy sits in the WORKSPACE
// (`workspaces/bugbounty/actors/dnsfacts`), four levels under the repo root, so the SDK is
// ../../../../sdk/go. It said ../../../kontra/sdk/go — the path a SIBLING kontra-actors
// checkout uses, inherited unchanged when the actor moved here under ADR 0049 — and that
// resolves from nowhere: `go build` failed on a missing directory rather than on anything the
// author wrote, so this module had not compiled since the move. `kontra deploy` builds a Go
// actor with the REPO ROOT as the Docker context, which it must, because these replaces point
// outside the actor dir. Same line as desync's, and for the same reason.
replace github.com/medmahmoudi26/kontra/sdk/go => ../../../../sdk/go

replace github.com/medmahmoudi26/kontra/runtime/go => ../../../../runtime/go
